.TH ASPEN-SITE-PERMS 8 "" "aspen-discovery" "Aspen Discovery"
.SH NAME
aspen-site-perms \- set the ownership and permissions Aspen expects
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aspen-site-perms
.I site
|
.B \-\-all
|
.B \-\-global
.SH DESCRIPTION
Codifies the chowns from the legacy setup_aspen_user_debian.sh and
updateSitePermissions_debian.sh scripts. The
.B \-\-global
form covers the shipped code tree and the top level data and log
directories and is run from the package postinst; the per-site form is
run at site creation and migration.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR aspen-create-site (8),
.BR aspen-migrate-from-git (8)
